# Who may publish/subscribe to what.  Docs: https://mosquitto.org/man/mosquitto-conf-5.html (acl_file)

# The server reads every device's readings and writes every device's commands.
user smartbed-server
topic read smartbed/+/readings
topic write smartbed/+/commands
topic read smartbed/+/status

# The simulator pretends to be the two fake beds' devices, and nothing else.
user smartbed-simulator
topic write smartbed/sim-patrick/readings
topic write smartbed/sim-siobhan/readings
topic read smartbed/sim-patrick/commands
topic read smartbed/sim-siobhan/commands

# Each device logs in with its device_id as username (%u), and can only
# publish its OWN readings and read its OWN commands. A stolen Pi password
# therefore can't write onto another resident's bed.
pattern write smartbed/%u/readings
pattern write smartbed/%u/status
pattern read smartbed/%u/commands
